  "bodyHash": "bb483df8c50543f7",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f41d3a8e-4294-4e3a-8269-c6d6a2f36d17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>繁<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">盛</span>芳<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">馨</span>天<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">堂</span></strong></span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1cb0d92a-266b-4878-b73a-20f0fa42275d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>1. 一些清新新穎的花卉與作物<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_550ced89-9369-46d2-99d9-fc5b2bcdae4e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>加入模組的世界後，你將會遇見新的花卉與作物。</li>\n<li>這些花朵可能稀有也可能常見，但請不要吝嗇你的背包，盡可能地收集它們吧！</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">2. 兩個帥氣的收納口袋</span></strong> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_90ded53e-52f2-4fd7-aaf9-1f92b5de47a4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7f8a39ae-eabe-4ff2-9a65-420663b387e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>兩種容易製作的袋子，擁有 27 個收納欄位。</li>\n<li>僅能存放探險途中獲得的種子與花朵</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">3. 新的合成配方</span></strong>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_717e9de7-21d7-4ba1-9d55-96b80cb76f88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9369ee6c-9684-4e07-9580-1f24544d3152.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>若要晾乾，將物品放上，然後等待。</li>\n<li>若要泡茶，將茶壺放在熱源上方（營火或煙燻爐方塊）&nbsp;</li>\n<li>準備好材料與水，然後等待。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#520cf0\">4. 來泡茶吧！這是本模組的重點</span></strong> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_af50040d-ac6a-4892-8475-78e5ffd3836d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_64a40d66-1576-49f8-9c5f-0f678810f11f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_52825c70-8dad-4a4d-aad8-dd569e28f8ec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15e71b2f-e41d-4e26-b847-1b4104cc63c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>超過 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>七十</strong></span> 種獨特飲品！</li>\n<li>每一款都能提供實用的效果！</li>\n<li>它是你冒險生活的最佳夥伴！</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">5. 一位新村民與一把獨特的武器。</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新村民：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>花<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">匠</span></strong></span>。會在<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">花桌</span>工作。</li>\n<li>等級 5 的花匠可以交易獲得新武器</li>\n<li>升級後的武器會根據副手所持的花朵提供不同的效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_05ceed23-d6f3-41d7-a1ef-969145a59111.png\" alt=\"\">圖鑑<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8061c3ad-603a-4e53-878b-bb52a5d2a4e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></em></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>多款飲品！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2d11bb12-59f9-4b0a-8c84-ab24129a5b73.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"360\"></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>目前支援 Minecraft 1.20.1&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.20.1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>支援語言：英文、簡體中文（中國大陸）、繁體中文（中國臺灣）、日文（日本）、文言文（華夏）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>如果你喜歡本模組，歡迎在 Patreon 上支持我&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://patreon.com/Royling?utm_medium=unknown&utm_source=join_link&utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&utm_content=copyLink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Royling | Patreon</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
